  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Matrices are rectangular arrays of numbers. The IGCSE Extended syllabus requires you to add, multiply and invert 2×2 matrices, and use the inverse to solve a pair of simultaneous equations.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — 2×2 Matrix Rules",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "For \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;b\\\\c&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}\\): &nbsp;\n          <strong>det</strong>\\((A)=ad-bc\\). &nbsp;\n          <strong>Inverse:</strong> \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{ad-bc}\\begin{pmatrix}d&amp;-b\\\\-c&amp;a\\end{pmatrix}\\) (exists only when det ≠ 0). &nbsp;\n          <strong>Multiplication</strong>: \\((AB)_{ij}=\\sum_k A_{ik}B_{kj}\\); only defined when columns of \\(A\\) = rows of \\(B\\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "det(A)",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\(ad-bc\\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Inverse \\(A^{-1}\\)",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\(\\dfrac{1}{\\det A}\\begin{pmatrix}d&amp;-b\\\\-c&amp;a\\end{pmatrix}\\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Solve \\(A\\mathbf{x}=\\mathbf{b}\\)",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\(\\mathbf{x}=A^{-1}\\mathbf{b}\\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Singular matrix",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\(\\det A=0\\) — no inverse",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 11.A — Matrix multiplication",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find \\(AB\\) where \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\3&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\) and \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;4\\\\-1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\).</p>\\[AB=\\begin{pmatrix}2(1)+1(-1)&amp;2(4)+1(2)\\\\3(1)+0(-1)&amp;3(4)+0(2)\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;10\\\\3&amp;12\\end{pmatrix}.\\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 11.B — Inverse and simultaneous equations",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Solve: \\(3x+2y=8\\) and \\(x-y=1\\) using the inverse matrix method.</p><p>Write as \\(\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;2\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\).</p><p>\\(\\det=-3-2=-5\\). &nbsp; \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{-5}\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;-2\\\\-1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0.2&amp;0.4\\\\0.2&amp;-0.6\\end{pmatrix}\\).</p>\\[\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0.2&amp;0.4\\\\0.2&amp;-0.6\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\\]<p>Solution: \\(x=2,\\;y=1\\).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "practiceProblem",
        "question": {
          "en": "\\(M=\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;2\\\\3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\). Find (a) det(\\(M\\)), (b) \\(M^{-1}\\), (c) solve \\(M\\mathbf{x}=\\begin{pmatrix}7\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "(a) \\(5-6=-1\\). (b) \\(M^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{-1}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-2\\\\-3&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;2\\\\3&amp;-5\\end{pmatrix}\\). (c) \\(\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;2\\\\3&amp;-5\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}7\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "quizWidget": {
    "enabled": true
  }
}
